{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","阿塔兰忒"],["/names/en","Atalanta"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名身手矫健的射手，擅长在中近距离制造范围伤害。"],["/description_i18n/en","A nimble Marksman who knows how to deal AoE damage at medium and short-range distances."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","说好了，宝藏归我！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","I'll take the treasure, that's the deal."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哼哼，收获不小哦~"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Haha! Not a bad haul."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","嘿！看这儿！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Hey! Over here!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","切，失手了……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Ggghh... my bad..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","胜利是最棒的宝物！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","The greatest treasure is victory."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","哦？我闻到了宝藏的味道~"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Oh, I smell treasure around here."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","不够锋利了，糟了，换新的。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Hm, not sharp enough. Forget it! I'll get a new one."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","舒服。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Phew! What a relief!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","这天气。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Hh... a-atchoo! Oh, bad weather."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这么珍贵的东西，送出手了可别反悔啊——谢啦！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Well, thanks! Try not to regret giving away something this precious!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","虽然不是宝贝，不过也不错啦。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Although it's not a treasure, it's still quite nice."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这份藏宝图不太准确啊……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","This map isn't quite accurate..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","接下来的宝藏在哪呢~"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","Where's the next treasure?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","来点甜食！什么都行！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I want to have some dessert. Anything sweet will do!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","啊哈，挺有氛围的嘛！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","This really gets me in the festive spirit!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","准备点特别礼物吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's prepare some special gifts!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇，金灿灿的灯笼！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Wow, golden lanterns!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","等会儿一起出门逛街？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Want to shop together later?"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒的弩是她亲手制作并改造过许多次的——虽然是重弩的形制，但重量加倍减轻，紧急时还能单手发射。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Atalanta crafted and modified her crossbow herself. It appears as a heavy crossbow but is light enough to be wielded with one hand in emergencies."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒非常怕辣，据说连一点点胡椒粉都会让她喷嚏连连。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Atalanta hates spicy food; it's rumored that even a hint of black pepper can make her sneeze."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒有种天赋，她总能凭着直觉，迅速而准确地判定事物的真伪：这在寻宝、打探消息和夺路而逃的时候派上过不少用场。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Atalanta possesses a unique gift—her instincts can rapidly discern the truth, which is very useful in treasure hunting, intelligence gathering, and escaping."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒在飞镖方面也同样擅长——她曾经在二十步外用一根牙签随手击穿一片叶子。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Skilled in darts, Atalanta once pierced a leaf with a toothpick from a distance of 20 feet."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒总能满载而归，但每次都“恰好”擦着违法的边缘潇洒地大步通过。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Atalanta never returns empty-handed and always skirts \"on the edge\" of breaking the law."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","“她要是能把精力专注在机械发明上，绝对成就非凡！”某位被阿塔兰忒撬开了最新结构防盗锁的矮人工匠如此评价。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","A dwarf craftsman once said, \"If she focused on mechanical inventions, she'd achieve something extraordinary,\" after Atalanta picked his latest anti-theft lock."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒能用鞭梢卷回几米外沙滩上的一颗石子，而不震起半点沙粒。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Once on a deserted beach, Atalanta plucked a pebble from five meters away with the tip of her whip without kicking up any sand."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒从三岁起，就没有在任何的捉迷藏大赛里输过；但同样也没赢过——没有人能够找到她，自然也就没人给她颁奖。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Atalanta hasn't lost a hide-and-seek game since she turned three, but she's never won either, as no one could find her."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒并不擅长琢磨谜语，在面对密码谜题的时候她通常选择物理手段——简称撬锁。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Riddles aren't her forte. When faced with obstacles that require passwords or secret codes, Atalanta usually opts for the physical solution, i.e., lockpicking or dynamite."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","冬青学会的学者中间流传着一个笑话：你无法在遗迹里同时找到宝物和阿塔兰忒。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Scholars at the Evergreen Conservatory joke: \"You can't find the treasure and Atalanta in the same ruin.\""],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","这份藏宝图不太准确啊……"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","This map isn't quite accurate..."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415052.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415052.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Atalanta"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","来点甜食！什么都行！"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","I want to have some dessert. Anything sweet will do!"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415053.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415053.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Atalanta"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","啊哈，挺有氛围的嘛！"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","This really gets me in the festive spirit!"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415353.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415353.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Atalanta"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","准备点特别礼物吧！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Let's prepare some special gifts!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415354.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415354.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Atalanta"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","哇，金灿灿的灯笼！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Wow, golden lanterns!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415521.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415521.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Atalanta"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","等会儿一起出门逛街？"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Want to shop together later?"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415522.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415522.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Atalanta"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒小姐为什么要在腰上挂一支鞭子呢？"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Why does Atalanta carry a whip at her waist?"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414050.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414050.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 阿塔兰忒"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Atalanta"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","没想到，你身手居然这么快……"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","I didn't expect you to be so quick with your hands..."],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414100.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414100.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒 & 维伦"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Atalanta & Valen"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","寻宝需要的是智慧、灵巧和运气，三者缺一不可……"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","Treasure hunting requires wisdom, agility, and luck. All three are indispensable."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn3/herohub_story/10414160.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn3/herohub_story/10414160.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","阿塔兰忒 & 菲"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Atalanta & Fay"]]}